| **Brundtland / Our Common Future** | **Limits to Growth** | 1987 WCED vs 1972 Club of Rome (Topic 8) |
| **Aspirant / Performer / Front-runner / Achiever** | **Any other score bands** | 0–49 / 50–64 / 65–99 / 100 |
